scslide-py Notice and Source Attribution
========================================

`scslide-py` is an independent native Python software package implementing
sample-level single-cell representations, weighted nearest-neighbor landmark
aggregation, diffusion trajectories, and R-compatible descriptive differential
expression workflows.

